That's not true!
Goody two-shoes!

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:34.520
Maybe not...

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.350
What?
Maybe not...

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:35.430
Maybe not...

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:39.260
After all, you were supposed to
go out on a date with Hikaru...

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:42.820
...and you stood her up and went on
a boat-ride with me at the park.

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:48.970
How rotten...

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:52.200
Gee... How mean...
How rotten...

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:55.570
You know what guys like you are called?

00:19:56.940 --> 00:20:00.170
G...I...G...O...L...O...

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:07.030
Seems that when Ayukawa is like this...

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:10.920
...there's... there's really
nothing that I can do.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:12.820
Are you really in love?

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.550
What?!
Are you really in love?

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:14.630
Are you really in love?

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:17.540
With Hikaru...

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:19.560
Sorry...

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:32.970
"Bus Schedule"

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:41.080
Tonight, Ayukawa seemed
like such a fun person...

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:44.330
Oh, I forgot! Today was a holiday!

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:48.720
What?! You're right!
The last bus is long gone!

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:05.800
Say...

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:14.460
That moment... I didn't know
exactly why, but...

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:18.650
...it seemed that I could sense what
she was going to say next...

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:23.120
Just for tonight...
can you let me stay over?

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:29.560
A... Ayukawa...

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:34.130
I won't tell... Hikaru about it...

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:42.020
Ayukawa... I'm... I'm... er,
let me be honest...

00:21:42.020 --> 00:21:45.410
...in no way am I a man of strong will,
so... I'm just not, well...

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.760
Yahoo! I'm back!

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.160
H...Hikaru!

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:01.220
Did you just get off work?
H...Hikaru!

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:06.510
You knew?!

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:09.630
Yeah. Madoka was kind enough to call
me and tell me about it last night.

00:22:10.110 --> 00:22:12.520
Oh... I see.

00:22:12.520 --> 00:22:15.920
Oh, my... She's fallen asleep!

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:18.040
Yeah...

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:23.580
So, it wasn't... a secret just between
the two of us, after all!

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:27.320
Well, Sempai, see you!

00:22:29.990 --> 00:22:33.490
But, boy... what was that all about...?

00:22:34.970 --> 00:22:39.640
"Just for tonight...
can you let me stay over?"

00:22:39.640 --> 00:22:42.880
What was that...?

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:44.870
What did that mean...?

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:50.280
What was that all about...?

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:09.230
I can't sleep!

00:23:12.440 --> 00:23:14.400
We're home!
We're home!

00:23:16.470 --> 00:23:19.670
What're you doing here?!
You were supposed to be back tomorrow!

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:23.290
Well, it so happens that I was able to
get hold of tickets for tonight, so...

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:26.060
Oniichan, we got a souvenir for you! Look!

00:23:26.060 --> 00:23:27.850
Huh? Where?

00:23:31.020 --> 00:23:32.550
Kurumi!

00:23:32.990 --> 00:23:36.260
C'mon! I didn't wanna have to pay to ship it!

00:23:39.500 --> 00:23:45.800
H...E...L...P...!

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:12.540
I dream of casting a spell that captures your heart...

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:20.110
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:20.110 --> 00:24:35.460
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory.
I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:35.460 --> 00:24:48.070
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:48.070 --> 00:24:58.280
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:58.280 --> 00:25:05.290
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:25:05.290 --> 00:25:16.690
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:23.500 --> 00:25:25.240
What's up with that kid?!

00:25:25.240 --> 00:25:27.240
This Hino Yuusaku, or whatever he said his name was...

00:25:27.240 --> 00:25:29.880
...he keeps following me around!

00:25:29.880 --> 00:25:32.650
I'm really busy now getting help with
my studies from Ayukawa...

00:25:32.650 --> 00:25:35.920
...and not only that,
I have to tutor Hikaru too!

00:25:35.920 --> 00:25:39.920
Next time: "That Kid's My Rival -
Midterm Exam of Love"
